@page "/about"

<PageTitle>House Proud Cleaning Solutions - About Us</PageTitle>

<section class="hero">
    <h1>About House Proud Cleaning Solutions</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">
        We're a local, family-run cleaning company dedicated to making your home
        or workplace shine — without the hassle.
    </p>
</section>

<section class="section">
    <h2>Our Story</h2>
    <p>
        House Proud Cleaning Solutions was founded with a simple goal: to give people back their time
        by taking cleaning off their to-do list. Fully insured and DBS checked, we take pride in
        delivering a trustworthy service with genuine attention to detail and a friendly approach.
    </p>
    <p>
        Whether you need regular maintenance cleaning or a one-off deep clean, we're committed to
        helping busy households across Sutton Coldfield and the surrounding areas stay house proud.
    </p>
</section>

<section class="section">
    <h2>Our Values</h2>
    <div class="card-grid">
        <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">🤝</div>
            <h3>Trustworthy Service</h3>
            <p>Fully insured and DBS checked, so you can feel confident letting us into your home.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">✨</div>
            <h3>Attention to Detail</h3>
            <p>From skirting boards to door frames, no corner is overlooked.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">🌍</div>
            <h3>Local &amp; Friendly</h3>
            <p>Proudly covering Sutton Coldfield and the surrounding areas with a friendly approach.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="text-align:center;">
    <h2>Want to Learn More?</h2>
    <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Get in Touch</a>
</section>
